<title>USA: PLC Systems hit by third class action suit.</title>
<headline>PLC Systems hit by third class action suit.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PLC Systems Inc Monday was hit by a third class action suit in the wake of its stock price dropping 56 percent after regulators rejected its heart laser system.</p>
<p>The law firm of Berger &amp; Montague PC said it filed the suit in the U.S. District Court for the District of Massachusetts and is seeking class action status for PLC shareholders who bought their shares between August 16 1996 and July 25.</p>
<p>PLC shares traded at 13-5/8 Monday, up 3/8.</p>
